# Line endings (ROADMAP 70 H4, owner decision 2026-10-12): LF in the repository and in the working tree; Windows batch files keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ogg binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.class binary

# Hashed fixture trees (ROADMAP 77.23): their recorded hashes cover the exact bytes, so checkout must not rewrite line endings.
fixtures/runtime-context/** -text
fixtures/translation-conformance/** -text
# Generated files (ROADMAP-3 item 80.1): on a merge conflict take theirs and regenerate (tools/merge-regen.py). Needs the one-time
# `git config merge.bfregen.driver "python tools/merge-regen.py %O %A %B %P"`, see CLAUDE.md. CI still fails a stale file.
tests/cli_help_golden.json merge=bfregen
docs/COMMANDS.md merge=bfregen
docs/CHECKS.md merge=bfregen
